# koch.turtle -- the Koch snowflake, first two levels, in three colours.
#
# Each side of the triangle is replaced by four segments with a bump in the
# middle of it; `repeat 3` walks the three sides.  The second, finer pass draws
# the same triangle subdivided once more.

colour red
repeat 3 [ forward 20  right 60  forward 20  left 120  forward 20  right 60  forward 20  right 120 ]

colour orange
repeat 3 [ forward 5  right 60  forward 5  left 120  forward 5  right 60  forward 5  right 60  forward 5  left 120  forward 5  right 60  forward 5  right 120 ]

colour gold
forward 1
